WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
Good morning, Hank! it's Wednesday.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:08.340
So, Sarah and I know the tunes to a lot of lullabies but we don't know the words to any of those lullabies.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:10.940
Which has necessitated us coming up with our own lyrics.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.340
Nowhere is this phenomenon weirder

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:15.120
than in the list of things

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.300
that daddy is going to buy Henry

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.860
in the event that the mockingbird doesn't sing.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:23.940
♪ Hush little baby, don't say a word ♪

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:27.860
♪ Daddy's gonna buy you a mockingbird ♪

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:31.880
♪ And if that mockingbird don't sing ♪

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:36.080
♪ Daddy's gonna buy you a diamond ring ♪

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:40.120
♪ And if that diamond ring don't shine ♪

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.520
♪ Well, daddy's gonna buy you a case of wine ♪

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:50.620
♪ And-if-because-you're-an-infant-and-not-allowed-to-drink-that wine should go sour ♪

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:55.080
♪ Daddy's gonna buy you a superpower ♪

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:59.420
♪ And if that superpower proves corrupting ♪

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:03.660
♪ Daddy's gonna buy a volcano erupting ♪

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:06.620
♪ And if that eruption produces too much ash ♪

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:10.420
♪ Daddy's gonna buy you a diaper rash ♪

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:17.500
♪ And if that diaper rash ♪ actually.... isn't.. desirable and besides that can't be bought.

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:21.480
♪ Well, daddy's gonna buy you some polka dots ♪

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:23.380
*kiss kiss* (mwah~~)

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:24.280
Polka dots!

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:27.700
♪ And if those polka dots aren't your style ♪

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:31.120
♪ Daddy's gonna buy a Pacific Isle ♪

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.020
♪ And if that Pacific Isle.. is in fact-way-too-expensive

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:37.620
for-daddy-to-purchase

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:39.440
and-he-defaults-on-his-loan

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:41.480
and-gets-foreclosed-upon

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:46.140
Daddy's gonna buy you the Sultanate of Oman ♪

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:49.600
♪ And if, given the fact that daddy couldn't afford a tiny island, ♪

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:54.040
-his promise to buy you a sovereign nation is plainly silly-

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:57.980
♪ Daddy's gonna buy you some waterlilies ♪

00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:01.580
♪ And if those water lilies ever should wilt ♪

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:05.420
♪ Daddy's gonna buy you a hand-knit quilt  ♪

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:10.480
♪ And if after all that you still weep ♪

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:14.100
♪ Daddy's gonna have to grapple-with-the-fact-that-

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:16.400
♪ while-buying-goods-and-services-

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.380
